{"id":"33caf35c6b40fa0f","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-ax-hilbert-forall.md","title":"Hilbert Quantifier Axiom Schema 1 (∀-Distribution)","display":"ax-hilbert-forall — Hilbert Quantifier Axiom Schema 1 (∀-Distribution)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-hilbert-forall","aliases":["58-ax-hilbert-forall"],"display":"ax-hilbert-forall — Hilbert Quantifier Axiom Schema 1 (∀-Distribution)","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-hilbert-forall"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-hilbert-forall</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-hilbert-forall — Hilbert Quantifier Axiom Schema 1 (∀-Distribution)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> is a first-order signature</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}forall} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\psi))\\to((\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to(\\forall x\\,\\psi))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}forall} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\psi))\\to((\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to(\\forall x\\,\\psi))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达全称量词的<strong>内部分配律</strong></li>\n<li>若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x) \\to \\psi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x) \\to \\psi(x)\\)</span>，则从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\;\\psi(x)\">\\(\\forall x\\;\\psi(x)\\)</span></li>\n<li>此公理与全称实例化公理不同，后者涉及项替换</li>\n<li>The former <code>df-universal</code> dependency concerned representing objects in category theory and was unrelated to the logical quantifier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$ and $\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}forall} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\Bigl((\\forall x\\,(\\varphi\\to\\psi))\\to((\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to(\\forall x\\,\\psi))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(x) \\to \\psi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\varphi(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\;\\psi(x)","display":false}],"bytes":1103,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-ax-hilbert-forall.md|58-ax-hilbert-forall]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}